    {
      "name": "report_results",
      "displayName": "Report Results",
      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "results-title",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# Report Results (Gold layer)\n",
                "Computed by the `signal_report` notebook via the impulse reporting framework. **These are event-scoped, duration-weighted aggregations — not the full raw signal.** Each metric summarizes only the time windows where its event holds:\n",
                "- **RPM histogram · Speed histogram · RPM-vs-Speed heatmap** — scoped to the **RPM event** (Engine RPM between 2000 and 5000 rpm). Values are **duration in seconds** spent in each band/cell, not sample counts.\n",
                "- **Per-container statistics** — min / median / mean / max over the **full measurement** (the whole drive, `container_event`).\n",
                "- **Speed & RPM at each 10 km milestone** — values sampled at the **instant** the odometer crosses each additional 10 km (`distance_milestones`), so these are discrete points, not a continuous trace."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "rpm-histogram",
            "queries": [
